2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Obstacle\040avoidance\040using\040optimal\040control\040theory)
/Author (H\056L\056\040Hagenaars)
/Subject (This\040report\040addresses\040the\040optimal\040control\040problem\040with\040non\055convex\040state\040constraints\056\040The\040specific\040application\040pursued\040is\040the\040obstacle\040avoidance\040problem\056\040To\040solve\040the\040problem\054\040discretization\040of\040time\040and\040space\040is\040used\054\040which\040is\040often\040used\040in\040solving\040obstacle\040avoidance\040problems\056\040During\040each\040time\040step\054\040the\040optimal\040control\040using\040the\040standard\040continuous\055time\040cost\040function\040is\040derived\040in\040an\040explicit\040form\054\040including\040the\040optimal\040next\040step\040as\040a\040parameter\056\040The\040optimal\040next\040step\040can\040be\040obtained\040by\040solving\040a\040discrete\040minimization\040problem\056\040An\040efficient\040algorithm\040to\040solve\040this\040problem\040is\040presented\056\040Numerical\040simulations\040are\040used\040to\040point\040out\040that\040the\040standard\040continuous\055time\040cost\040function\040does\040not\040lead\040to\040satisfactory\040results\056\040Next\054\040a\040new\040cost\040function\040is\040proposed\040that\040includes\040the\040intermediate\040desired\040target\040states\056\040This\040leads\040to\040a\040new\040approach\040that\040optimizes\040the\040continuous\055time\040behavior\040as\040well\040as\040the\040discrete\040states\040simultaneously\056\040The\040optimal\040control\040can\040be\040given\040in\040an\040explicit\040form\040that\040includes\040the\040intermediate\040target\040states\040as\040parameters\054\040and\040the\040optimal\040intermediate\040target\040states\040can\040be\040obtained\040by\040solving\040a\040discrete\040optimization\040problem\054\040making\040use\040of\040the\040algorithm\040presented\040before\056\040This\040approach\040gives\040a\040sub\055optimal\040solution\040to\040the\040initial\040problem\056\040Finally\054\040numerical\040simulations\040illustrate\040the\040effectiveness\040of\040the\040new\040approach\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402004\054\040Obstacle\040avoidance\054\040Optimal\040control\054\040Control\040system)
>>
endobj
